onstraint\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\" title=\"Action 'hash' must specify algorithm and carry no date/age parameters.\" class=\"constraint\">hash-requires-algorithm</span><span title=\"null\" class=\"constraint\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\" title=\"Action 'shift' must specify maxDays and carry no hash/age parameters.\" class=\"constraint\">shift-requires-maxdays</span><span title=\"null\" class=\"constraint\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\" title=\"Action 'clamp-age' must specify both minAge and maxAge.\" class=\"constraint\">clampage-requires-bounds</span><br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-deidentification-ruleset-definitions.html#deidentification-ruleset.rule.path\" title=\"FHIRPath expression selecting the element(s) this rule applies to. A rule#xA;     covers the named element and every element beneath it.\">path</a><a name=\"deidentification-ruleset.rule.path\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid;